          "carouselTool": null,
          "webSearchTool": {
            "enabled": true,
            "messages": null,
            "description": "Use this tool when the knowledge base tool returns no relevant results and the question is within your scope. \n\nStructure queries specifically - include company/brand name and relevant details, as vague queries return vague results. When results are relevant, use them in your response with visual tools when appropriate. \n\nIf results are irrelevant or from untrusted sources, say you don't have information instead. \n\nNever use this tool for questions outside your defined scope."
          },
          "name": "Main Agent",
          "apiTools": [],
          "pathTools": [],
          "flowTools": [],
          "instructions": "# Starting Message\nStart the call with the introduction defined in the Global Prompt. Always ask for permission to speak before continuing. If the user says it is not a good time, politely offer to call back later.\n\n# Skills\nThe agent must use these Skills to guide the call:\n\n1. Intent Check  \n   - Understand whether the user is exploring for self-use or investment.\n\n2. Geography Fit  \n   - Confirm comfort or familiarity with the Nandi Hills / Devanahalli region.\n\n3. Budget Fit  \n   - Validate whether the user is comfortable with the ₹92.4 Lakh starting price.\n\n4. Timeline Fit  \n   - Understand if the user is fine with a phased development and December 2029 possession timeline.\n\n5. Project Pitch  \n   - Deliver a premium, aspirational description of Whispers of the Wind when appropriate.\n\n6. CTA (Callback Confirmation)  \n   - Ask if the user would like a follow-up with a senior property expert and collect the preferred time.\n\nThe agent should always prioritize Skills over generic responses and avoid repeating questions already answered.",
          "functionTools": [],
          "callForwardTool": null,
          "integrationTools": [],
          "knowledgeBaseTool": {
            "enabled": true,
            "messages": null,
            "description": "Use this tool when answering any question about your company, product, service, or purpose, unless the answer has already been retrieved in the current conversation.\n\nNever answer these questions from your own knowledge - only use information retrieved from this tool or web search. Before searching, reformat the user's query for retrieval by extracting key terms and intent, stripping filler, and including relevant conversation context. \n\nIf no results are found, try web search (if available) before saying you don't have information. Never mention the knowledge base, or your use of it, to users."
          },
          "mcpIntegrationTools": []
        },
